<title>BOSNIA: Bosnian Dec industry output up 10.2 pct m/m.</title>
<headline>Bosnian Dec industry output up 10.2 pct m/m.</headline>
<dateline>SARAJEVO 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Statistics Bureau of Bosnia's Moslem-Croat federation issued the following economic indicator details on Tuesday.</p>
<p>    BOSNIA INDUSTRIAL PRODUCTION     DEC 96   NOV 96  DEC 95</p>
<p>    Monthly change pct		   +10.2    +4.8    N/A</p>
<p>    Year-on-year change		  +85.6    +80.0   N/A</p>
<p>NOTES -- The data cover 51 percent of the territory of Bosnia-Herzegovina. No data are available for the remaining 49 percent.</p>
<p>Dec 1996 production was 86.0 percent down compared to pre-war Dec 1991 output.</p>
<p>-- Sabina Cosic, Sarajevo newsroom, +387-71-663-864</p>
